unreleased (2.0.0 when it ships) - the report data file is a YAML document (.yaml); the hand-written .rdf text format and its parser are removed; scripts/rdf2yaml.py converts an existing .rdf base as a starting point
unreleased - default date formats are ISO 8601 ('%Y-%m-%d', '%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S') instead of the locale forms '%x'/'%c'; a date that does not read as a date is refused
unreleased - removed *timeformat, a setting from an early version that was never implemented
unreleased - a pptx finish=True run works again: the finishing pass used Word's Close(SaveChanges=True), which PowerPoint's Close() does not accept, so the re-save and the PDF export always failed silently; PowerPoint now really rewrites the deck and createpdf delivers its PDF
